          <div class="mb-1 font-display font-bold text-signal">Patient Safety</div>
          <div class="text-[0.85rem] text-slate">Reduces risk of infections and accidents. Ensures availability and functionality of critical services. Ensures emergency preparedness and prevents untoward incidents.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-hairline border-t-[3px] border-t-ink bg-white p-5">
